    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ghoang'eat gheambalmeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut, ng'ata goombaliischi gweanyeew diktam ea shageash aba Yerusalemu. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Abiya was hudeaba Sakariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gida ghayi sinda ghweandaanyi was Dawdi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giighaydiita gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweayda madeeda bea gheambalmeadaanyi, bea sheeda madeeda, hean ghwajaat gidaghuudajeega gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gabiikta gwasin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoaghuumda gah ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ak ghabwada geat aba seamooda heeda ghayeawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha, “Ooleeysiinean iita, Ea fuga Lawi, asi ookghaydiida geat ak ghoakghaydiichi eara gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweanigeagwa, ak gooruuteawi heeda ghaydit gilinyoo ea muy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghweandeanya niny ghayi miy doabiiwaat nea nisin gida muy aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, nea ea nijakta niny, nea ea niyam iheenga nyaawa gwasheagiida heeda abiita NG'UTAMIIDA, ak goofuursa badahuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwarat eara gidaghuudajeega doodooda ak gwanuus beasta gheaboonyanga, ak ea mii ghaghwarda geediga ng'andidi ghana ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida aba heeda ghaydit bea ASEETA fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA iheenga fuga Yuda ea Yerusalemu, ak ghwanung' ghoah fuga jea gooboodani, nea gahama ng'eanyi, nea geebara reari, gawuurji gidoadaakti aba gheanyangeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goong'ulayi, ghweanigaasa gahuuyda ng'uta nea orjoagaasa, ea haweagaasa, ea gadeemgaasa ea niiw giing'oonyanga aba ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa gwanda gurooroodeanyu ng'asheanda gideaba gaydasin neajeeda sea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA fuga Israeli, ak abeeda ghoang'aamwa heedeanya nyarastaanyi ng'waan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea orjoogeasu adiidu goomiikti aseeta, aba gideaba niloadeagwa NG'UTAMIIDA ahuwa fuga jea gamiineadayi aba madeadaanyi, ak googadiyeesi niny, ak ghoahuuyi fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda nea googwariideayeesi niny geediga ng'andidi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eatng'eat fuga Lawi, Mahati orjeeda Amasayi, ea Yoeli orjeeda Asariya, was orjooga Gohati; nea orjooga Merari ea Gishi gil, was orjeeda Abdi, ea Asariya orjeeda Yehaleleli; nea orjooga Gershoni ea Yoha gil was orjeeda Sima ea Edeni orjeeda Yoha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea orjooga Elisafani, ea Shimri gil ea Yehueli; nea orjooga Asafu ea Sakariya gil ea Mataniya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea orjooga Hemani, ea Yehueli gil ea Shimeyi; nea orjooga Yedutuni, ea Shemaya gil ea Usieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwat geat buweadeega nyaawa, ak ghoaghaydiit geat, ak gaweay gah gawuurji gidarukuteayda sugoocheanda, aba ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA, gaweay goobuus gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay ashoohoodiga heeda duukusa gah bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA gaweay goobuus, aba ng'ata gooruuta jarooda gilinyoo ea mii miy sinyasa jeeda gheeda sibata NG'UTAMIIDA; aba ng'ata gageanda fuga Lawi ak gaweay gwajaksa jeeda ghealooda Gidroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'eat giighaydiita gidang'eada eaweeda madeeda bea sheeda, ak eaweeteaba sis bea sheeda ghapka doodooda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak aba eawooji sis ghoaghaydiit gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak aba eaweeteaba damwalah bea sheeda madeeda ghoahiit gadiyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheeda sibata ASEETA geebiikta eakghaydiit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay jeeda gheeda Hesekiya was sugoocheanda, ak gwayi, “siipuuschi jeeda gheeda sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ea heeda wagiida bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida, ea dabitaanyi sean, ea mukaatajeega giihiimnooda, ea dabitaanyi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haleanjeeda ghayi jakta sugoocheanda was Ahasi damanda sugoocheanduumeadaanyi iing'ata nea nihista NG'UTAMIIDA, sibiikti eesina ak geakghaydiichi, ak hean ging'ulayi, gwanda madeeda heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabay ghang'eat sakteayda duw sugoocheanda was Hesekiya, ak ghabwada geat fuga hees ahaaghwa mujiini, aba ng'ata gwadiyeesa heeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geeyeadu heewi ispwa, ea lagweendi ispwa, ea dayi ispwa gudea manang'i was lagweendiga, ea ghwarayi ispwa, ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea riing'eeda aba badayda sugoocheanduumeeda, ea aba badayda heeda ghaydit, ea aba badayda Yuda. Ak ghwanung' ghwayiin ashoohoodiga was orjooga Haruni heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwanuus heewga, ng'ata gagan ashoohoodiga foojeanda nyaawa ak gwasaksa badayda heeda wagiida; ng'ata gwanuus lagweendiga ak gwasaksa foojeanyeeka nyaawa heeda wagiida, ng'ata gwanuus lagweendiga was dayeega ak gwasaksa foojeanyeeka nyaawa heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ng'ata gooneekiit ghwarayga haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea riing'eeda ghapka heeda sugoocheanda ea heeda guuyeeda aba ng'ata ghwayiin geatinga nyaawa badahuuka nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gwanuus ashoohoodiga, ak ghoadayda foojeanda nyaawa ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea riing'eeda aba heeda wagiida ghoah giiduupcheeda aba heeda fuga sean bea Israeli; aba gideaba ghayi sugoocheanda gwarukuta gideaba fuga sean bea Israeli gajeesissa haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida ea gea riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin fuga Lawi jeeda gheeda fuga mideawa gureayeeka, ea ginaandajeega ea gidoondoorajeega gaweeda gidarukuteayda Dawdi ea Gadi was meang'nyeanda sugoocheanda ea sibaneeda siguura Natani; aba gideaba diigheanda gwaleabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwasku ghuusiga sibanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada fuga Lawi nea gwandeawa dabita Dawdi nea ashoohoodiga gwandeawa durumbeatajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukuta Hesekiya gideaba gajeatayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida aba heeda wagiida. Hean nea ghang'eat giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida, hean ghang'eat eara duumda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea durumbeatajeega nea goodeayi sea ginandajeega sugoocheanda was Dawdi bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ghadooweeda fuga bwat geat, aba ng'ata gwasarmani fuga sarmani, nea fuga mideawa durumbeatajeega ghwanung' goojuur; hean gadiyoojusu seaniin gaweay ea gamuudeani giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahit giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi, sugoocheanda sea fuga mideayi sea niny ghwahiiy geat ak ghaghadoawan niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sugoocheanda was Hesekiya sea fuga hees gwayeesha fuga Lawi aduumsheesiina NG'UTAMIIDA aba ng'asheega Dawdi ea Asafu was meang'nyeanda. Hean gwaduumsheesa aba hooseaneega, aba ng'ata ghwahiiy geat ak ghaghadoawan niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Hesekiya, “Ghamneawa noakghaydiichi geat aba ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA; asi apkaani aneekiida nea gooyeadu lukghumajeega ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea badiischooda jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA.” Hean gweadu eemeeda lukghumajeega ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea badiischooda, nea fuga sean inya jeesin gweadu haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mooneeda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida was gea eadu eemeeda heew laadam gil ea damanamughuush, laghweendi bughala, ea dayi bughalaji iyeenya bea gisilga; suh seaniin geanung' ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi siikghaydiit heew bughalaji lah gil ea gisil sagalamnyooji samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ashoohoodiga ea ng'ay nea moamu ghwajeayi haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida, hean gaweechi sea buweadeega nyaawa was fuga Lawi ea ghwahit gadiyeeda, nea ghoamuughu ghoaghaydiit geat ashoohoodiga suurja, aba gideaba fuga Lawi gwandeawa gurooruunatka doobiiweadi aba giighaydidandeaba geat ea ghang'al ashoohoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara ana seang'ayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida gwanda eara nagheeda bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo ea gea sighadoawanda guuyi sea haleanjeeda sisabwa geat sigwariida. Hean geang'eat gicha gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gahoosan Hesekiya sea fuga sean aba gida sissa ASEETA buuneeda; aba gideaba ng'asheanji ghwahidu nea gwasham fih.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
